Sun Oct 18 05:56:25 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <martin@pluskal.org>

- Update to 1.8.1:
  * Support EMF images without an initial viewport setup and with
    wrong transformation applied (e.g. Wine-generated files)
  * Fix incorrect handling of polygon fill modes and a crash in
    reverse font encoding memory handling
  * Emit width and height attributes even when Y-coordinates are
    repaired
  * New cmake USE_SYSTEM_LIBUEMF flag to use a system libuemf
    (still builds against the vendored copy by default)
  * New libxml2 dependency
  * Many more fixes and improvements; see upstream's release notes
    for the full list
- Spec cleanup: drop obsolete Group tags, use pkgconfig-style
  BuildRequires.

